header: "---\nname: youtube-shorts\ndescription: >-\n  The growth engine for YouTube Shorts in 2026. Use when someone asks to \"grow on Shorts,\"\n  \"get views on YouTube Shorts,\" \"write a Shorts script,\" \"why did my Short flop,\" \"make a\n  vertical YouTube video,\" or wants a Shorts strategy. Drafts the script; the human films/\n  edits; publishing routes through scheduling-and-queue -> WoopSocial; analytics are read\n  natively in YouTube Studio. Fully decoupled from, and sibling to, youtube-long-form.\nversion: 1.0.0\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
